W4/W6 — WHD coexistence characterization + shared-bus-lock fix    2026-06-19/20
==============================================================================
Board: rpi_pico2/rp2350a/m33/w   Debug Probe CMSIS-DAP if01
Build: build_whd_soak  CONFIG_CYW43_TRANSPORT_WHD=y WIFI_AIROC=y BT=y
